  m_text: "Panel with Manipulators lets you easily scale, transform, and rotate panels
    and their contents. To scale a panel, grab a white dot on any of the panel\u2019s
    corners. To rotate a panel, grab a white dot on the sides. To transform a panel,
    grab the panel\u2019s white border.\n\n\n<i>Long Text for Scrolling - Lorem ipsum
